Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.09,0:00:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yielding!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.87,0:00:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,yIELDing!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.97,0:01:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything is in place Kaiba and\Nlittle Yugi should be arriving
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.05,0:01:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Momentarily, with the hopeless\Nplan of rescuing you two. However,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.35,0:01:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,with both of you as my mind slaves\NThey'll have no choice but to play by my
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.73,0:01:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Rules. Their Egyptian god cards and\NYugi's puzzle will be mine for the taking.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.35,0:01:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And soon I'll rule the whole world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.65,0:01:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, my friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.91,0:01:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so quiet Almost as if you don't have\Nminds of your own When little Yugi sees
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.69,0:01:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,His best friends in my control. He'll have\Nno choice but to obey me, Master Merrick,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.39,0:01:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg your pardon What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.09,0:01:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,As you requested,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.41,0:01:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, I've secured 12 locator cards\Nfor the Battle City Finals. Excellent,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.47,0:01:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Odeon, you've done well.\NNow we both qualify.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.33,0:01:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,to participate in the\Nfinals If we need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.09,0:02:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hopefully that won't be required.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.65,0:02:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,In which case you've wasted\Na great deal of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.31,0:02:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But hand them over anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.61,0:02:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Entering the finals may be\Nnecessary if today's plan fails.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.73,0:02:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a privilege to serve you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.57,0:02:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I always have a backup plan to\Nensure that I get what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.11,0:02:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But today's setup seems foolproof.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.15,0:02:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Now hand my servant the deck\Nwe've prepared for him, Odeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.89,0:02:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, master.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.81,0:02:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,When Yugi is forced to battle\Nagainst his brainwashed best friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.27,0:02:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,he's sure to lose it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.61,0:02:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Replacing his pathetic deck\Nwith an unstoppable assortment
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.65,0:02:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,of extremely rare magic\Ncards was an excellent idea,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.73,0:02:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.05,0:02:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my most ingenious scheme yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.89,0:02:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I took the things that mean\Nthe most to Yugi, his friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.21,0:02:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Brilliant plan, Master. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.85,0:02:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now come and find me, little Yugi,\Nfor the last duel you'll ever fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.69,0:03:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as we land, Mokuba\Nwill lead us to my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.11,0:03:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll break in and get them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.29,0:03:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Yugi, I brought you here and\NI'll be calling all the shots today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.11,0:03:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And the first task on my agenda is to\Ntrack down the third Egyptian God Guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.11,0:03:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, we'll find your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.87,0:03:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.05,0:03:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey and Tea are in great danger,\Nand we must rescue them right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.87,0:03:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but it's obvious that you and I\Nhave very different priorities, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.19,0:03:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So why don't we split up and\Nfend for ourselves when we land?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.01,0:03:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That's foolish!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.41,0:03:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it is to you, but I've always\Nworked much better on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.91,0:03:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't you realized by now\Nthat teamwork's not my thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.47,0:03:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,When we battled against Loomis\Nand Umbra in that double duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.27,0:03:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,it was me who defeated them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.99,0:03:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,and without much help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.25,0:03:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,So do me a favor and stay out of my\Nway, Yugi, because we're finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.53,0:03:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I brought you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.93,0:03:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you can take care\Nof the rest by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.65,0:04:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I've done enough charity work already.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.33,0:04:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'm through.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.15,0:04:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll save my friends\Nwithout Kaiba's help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.97,0:04:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We're approaching our\Ntarget now, Mr. Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.93,0:04:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, I think I\Nsee someone on the pier.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.97,0:04:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And it kind of looks like Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.99,0:04:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it is Joey,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.69,0:04:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And he seems to be all alone. Get ready,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.07,0:04:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,my mind slave The fun\Nis about to begin Kaiba,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.13,0:04:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,we may be heading into a trap Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.73,0:04:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, I've heard enough out\Nof you for one day. All right,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.59,0:04:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Little Yugi. This is it. When\Nthat fool realizes I've turned his
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.61,0:04:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Best friend against him. He'll be\Ncompletely devastated. Ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.13,0:04:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.04,0:04:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over for you! Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.85,0:04:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.76,0:04:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.33,0:04:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey is not present. He's gone away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.59,0:04:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Merrick! That's correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.93,0:05:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you want your friends\Nback, you will listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.07,0:05:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.23,0:05:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That sure doesn't sound like Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.41,0:05:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be one of Merrick's\Ntricks. Listen, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.95,0:05:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to be in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.33,0:05:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.39,0:05:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, you listen, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.77,0:05:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We are playing by my regulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.49,0:05:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll release your pathetic friends\Nas soon as I get what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.73,0:05:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, since I want your\Npuzzle and Egyptian god card,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.01,0:05:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,there's only one way to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.23,0:05:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You and I are going to duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.41,0:05:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You're insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.83,0:05:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Refuse, and your friends are mine forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.25,0:05:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Release Joey from your control, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.31,0:05:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on, bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.59,0:05:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Mokuba,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.50,0:05:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,it appears that this Marek was somehow\Nable to turn Joey Wheeler against Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.29,0:05:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Wheeler wants to duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.27,0:05:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This should be interesting,\Nto say the very least.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.83,0:05:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting? But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.05,0:05:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if Wheeler is fighting on the\Nside of Marek and the Rare Hunters now,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.27,0:06:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,he may be holding the\Nthird Egyptian God card.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.19,0:06:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And I want that card in my deck, so\Nif it's played, I want to be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.83,0:06:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to seize the power that\Nshould have been mine all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.89,0:06:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, I know you can hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.63,0:06:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mind is under the control of Merrick,\Nand you must break free, understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.25,0:06:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The same Merrick you\Nvowed to help me crush.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.67,0:06:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Think, Joey,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.58,0:06:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,you've got to remember your promise\Nto me when you gave me your red eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.69,0:06:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.93,0:06:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll whoop this Merrick\Ncreep in his rare hunter
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.23,0:06:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,goon squad so hard they\Nwon't know what hit him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.09,0:06:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll be sorry that they\Never decided to mess with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.27,0:06:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Marek couldn't defeat me in a\Nduel. So he decided to turn you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.83,0:06:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,against me In order to win my\Npuzzle and my Egyptian god card
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.69,0:06:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey I know you're in there\Nand I'm going to set you free
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.17,0:06:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Marek's power is feeble compared\Nto the strength of our friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.93,0:06:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Please say something, Joey Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.31,0:07:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never set him free\Nunless you follow me, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.27,0:07:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.17,0:07:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.35,0:07:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Following Joey may lead to\Nanother one of Merrick's traps.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.41,0:07:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I don't go, how will\NI ever rescue Joey and Taya?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.09,0:07:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, you'd better do exactly as I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.43,0:07:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, Taya!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.99,0:07:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,This may come as an unpleasant surprise,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.77,0:07:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,but like your friend Joey,\NTaya too is under my control.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.85,0:07:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Surprised?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.76,0:07:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick, leave her alone now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.95,0:07:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,She's done nothing to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.25,0:07:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I've turned your closest\Nfriends into your greatest enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.25,0:07:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You're at my mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.13,0:07:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Tear!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.97,0:07:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to my very special dueling arena.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.03,0:07:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Look around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.19,0:07:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Should you accept,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.25,0:07:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll be battling against your\Nbest friends in a duel like
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.01,0:07:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,none you've ever experienced for\Nthe highest stakes imaginable.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.65,0:07:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.81,0:07:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If it means saving my\Nfriends, let's begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.83,0:08:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you both try these on for size?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.89,0:08:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Notice that you're both\Nsecurely fastened to a
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.73,0:08:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,chain that leads to a large\Nanchor hanging above you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.37,0:08:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Thirty seconds after a player's\Nlife points reach zero,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.07,0:08:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,the anchor will drop to\Nthe bottom of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.23,0:08:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.35,0:08:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Now look down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.93,0:08:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That small yellow box is\Nyour life point counter,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.41,0:08:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,but it also contains the\Nkey to your survival.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.05,0:08:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,When one player's life points reach zero,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.07,0:08:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,the other player's box opens, revealing\Na key that unlocks his shackles.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.49,0:08:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, you'll have 30 seconds to\Nfree yourself before the anchor drops.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.91,0:08:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So the loser of this duel will be\Ndragged to the bottom of the ocean,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.69,0:08:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,while the winner frees\Nhimself at the last minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.73,0:08:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.65,0:08:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite ingenious, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.09,0:08:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.21,0:08:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,If I win this duel, will you set my\Nfriends free from your control, Merrick?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.51,0:08:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have to fish Joey\Nout of the sea first.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.21,0:09:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't think I left little\NTaya out of all the fun,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.15,0:09:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'll get to her role shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.41,0:09:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And just in case you had any plans\Nof refusing to duel, think again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.85,0:09:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's no winner within 60 minutes,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.13,0:09:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,the anchor will automatically drop, sending\Nboth of you plummeting into the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.47,0:09:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.25,0:09:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But you will lose, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.51,0:09:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And before that anchor drops,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.53,0:09:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take your Millennium Puzzle\Nand your Egyptian God card.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.99,0:09:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.90,0:09:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not going to get away\Nwith any of this, Merrick. Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.95,0:09:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And Seto Kaiba, don't think you're\Nmerely a spectator in all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.91,0:09:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as I'm through with\Nlittle Yugi and his friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.57,0:09:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm setting my sights on\Nyour Egyptian god card,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.79,0:09:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Obelisk the Tormenter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.73,0:09:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I've heard enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.53,0:09:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel is getting\Nway out of hand, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.73,0:09:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You've gotta put a stop to\Nit before someone gets hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.31,0:09:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, Merrick may try\Nsomething like this on us next.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.79,0:09:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,As head of the Battle City Tournament,\NI demand that this duel be stopped now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.21,0:09:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but the duel will\Ncontinue as planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.59,0:10:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And speaking of plans, here's\Nthe final piece of my plot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.61,0:10:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.67,0:10:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Above Taya!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.05,0:10:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya, what is the\Nmeaning of this, Merrick?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.03,0:10:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that anchor won't be\Nthe only thing getting dropped.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.17,0:10:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I've taken extra measures to\Nmake sure no one interferes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.99,0:10:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,So don't try.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.01,0:10:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,If you attempt to stop this duel, the crate\Nyou see hanging over my head will fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.27,0:10:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't put poor\NTaya in danger, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.45,0:10:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Make one false move and I push the button,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.29,0:10:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,releasing the crate above the girl's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.21,0:10:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stop this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.47,0:10:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that everything seems to be in place
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.77,0:10:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,and everyone is familiar\Nwith all the rules,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.07,0:10:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,why don't we start the show?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.63,0:10:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait, I almost forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.03,0:10:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't want little\NTaya to miss all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.85,0:10:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Thea!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.89,0:10:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.03,0:11:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.77,0:11:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm trapped!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.53,0:11:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, there's one last matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.61,0:11:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, your Egyptian\NGod card is off limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.93,0:11:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So if you were planning on using\Nit against me, you're out of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.89,0:11:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Now remove the card from your\Ndeck so I may claim it when I win.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.69,0:11:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.59,0:11:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I keep my special cards in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.65,0:11:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't going to use Slifer anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.81,0:11:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.59,0:11:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.75,0:11:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I know something that may be able to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.05,0:11:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's Red-Eyes Black Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.13,0:11:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.13,0:11:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, Uke.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.33,0:11:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You hold on to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.83,0:11:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It isn't mine to take, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.29,0:11:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, this means that a part\Nof me will be a part of your deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.33,0:11:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I know it's going to\Ncome in handy for you someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.71,0:11:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,This red eyes meant so much to Joey,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.39,0:11:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,and he gave it to me as\Na sign of our friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.35,0:11:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm putting it in my deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.21,0:11:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I know the real Joey\Nis in there somewhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.61,0:12:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,and maybe there's a way I can use\Nthis card to save him from Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.25,0:12:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now place Slifer on the ground, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.25,0:12:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,So whoever wins will retrieve that\Ncard while the loser goes swimming.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.83,0:12:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon I'll possess Slifer the\NSky Dragon and Yugi's puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.35,0:12:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,My plan won't fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.69,0:12:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's finally\Ntime to begin this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.85,0:12:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.76,0:12:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Versus Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.75,0:12:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready to duel, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.23,0:12:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.43,0:12:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.61,0:12:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to lose, fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.93,0:12:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.63,0:12:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we finally made it, Serenity. Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.01,0:12:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.92,0:12:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You grew up here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.41,0:12:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet it's been ages since\Nyou've been back, hasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.43,0:12:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.34,0:12:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey and I used to hang out here\Nall the time when we were little.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.01,0:12:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It was the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.45,0:12:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I can picture it so clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.19,0:13:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like Joey and I were here\Njust yesterday. That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.31,0:13:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, speaking of your brother,\Nwe should go find him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.41,0:13:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.32,0:13:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be nice if I had\Na clue where Joey was.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.67,0:13:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me give Taya a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.57,0:13:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.73,0:13:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya's not picking up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.33,0:13:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That girl's always got her phone on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.97,0:13:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't get through.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.73,0:13:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,There they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.53,0:13:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, you draw the first call.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.07,0:13:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the beginning of the end for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.27,0:13:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to figure out\Na way to stop this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.23,0:13:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,When that anchor falls down, it's\Ntaking one or maybe both of us with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.25,0:13:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the problem, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.79,0:13:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you too frightened to play a card?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.65,0:13:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.05,0:13:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Gazelle, the\Nking of mythical beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.15,0:13:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That ends my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.35,0:13:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.79,0:14:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, say goodbye to your Gazelle, for\NI play Raigeki, which destroys him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.71,0:14:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, I summon Alligator Sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.87,0:14:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack his life once directly!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.17,0:14:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Surrender yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.37,0:14:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Or do you want more?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.21,0:14:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you're not going easy on me\Nbecause we're old friends, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.33,0:14:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.93,0:14:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not friends, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.21,0:14:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I play Big Shield Gardener!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.03,0:14:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.21,0:14:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you think that's enough to protect\Nyour life points, Yugi? So naive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.01,0:14:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I play my Hinotama magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.73,0:14:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Now watch closely as its power\Nblasts away your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.89,0:14:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.33,0:14:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the second time\Nhe attacked me directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.23,0:14:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, that third-rate duelist Wheeler never\Nhad cards that powerful in his deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.13,0:14:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So he is being helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.09,0:15:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like Yugi's\Nstarting to panic already.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.79,0:15:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,after getting a taste of my powerful deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.91,0:15:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Enhanced with cards\Ngathered by my rare hunters,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.01,0:15:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's deck is virtually unbeatable.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.51,0:15:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi will be out of my way shortly,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.69,0:15:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,leaving behind his puzzle\Nand his Egyptian god card.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.15,0:15:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon me, Master Merrick,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.71,0:15:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,but I've just learned that Joey's\Nsister has arrived in Battle City.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.65,0:15:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you say his sister? Yes, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.27,0:15:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,This sister of his may prove to be\Nan excellent pawn in my game, Odeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.21,0:15:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring the girl to me immediately. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.49,0:15:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent work, my mind slave.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.71,0:15:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll continue to use my\NMillennium Rod against your former
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.05,0:15:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,friend until his life points\Nare completely wiped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.47,0:15:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to figure a way out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.17,0:15:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already lost half my life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.21,0:15:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And if I lose this duel, the\Nwhole world is in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.45,0:15:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I win, my best friend\Ngets dragged into the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.71,0:15:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be a solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.07,0:15:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Time is running out, Yugi. He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.27,0:16:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,In less than an hour, that anchor drops\Nautomatically and we're both doomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.35,0:16:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.37,0:16:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Heart of the cards, guide me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.61,0:16:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my move.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.19,0:16:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I messed up big time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.11,0:16:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I should've asked the\Nguys where they wanted
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.87,0:16:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,to meet us before I left to go\Npick you up. Sorry. It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.99,0:16:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure we'll find everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.39,0:16:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.99,0:16:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.39,0:16:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,They've got to be in Battle City, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.27,0:16:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,So how far away could they have gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.59,0:16:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I'll see my big bro in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.93,0:16:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.45,0:16:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, who are you, pungs?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.85,0:16:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And what do you want from us?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.11,0:16:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.17,0:16:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you keep moving?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.59,0:16:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't want any trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.85,0:16:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You may not want any trouble, but we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.55,0:16:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan, what's happening? I'm scared.\NGet on my back. Okay. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.45,0:16:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let him get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.21,0:16:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what in the world is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.85,0:16:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is Yugi dueling against Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.39,0:16:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this some sort of freaky dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.53,0:17:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.09,0:17:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Some guy named Maric brainwashed\NJoey and forced him into a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.99,0:17:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did he do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.81,0:17:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Maric's trying to get his evil\Nhands on Yugi's Egyptian god card.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.67,0:17:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So he's forcing Joey to duel for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.67,0:17:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy's behind everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.89,0:17:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he must be the one Ishizu\Nwarned us to watch out for.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.67,0:17:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's making sense to me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.17,0:17:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.09,0:17:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop making a fuss, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.11,0:17:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't keep quiet, kid, you're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.13,0:17:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,So don't test me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.59,0:17:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.69,0:17:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have the guts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.07,0:17:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanna bet?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.98,0:17:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Kaiba, you've gotta\Nstop this duel right away,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.47,0:17:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,or the whole world may be in\Ndanger of being destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.67,0:17:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.93,0:17:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't. Too risky.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.15,0:17:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,If we try to stop this duel now,\Nwe'll be putting Taya in danger, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.21,0:17:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.67,0:17:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Time is of the essence.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.97,0:17:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And stalling's not an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.17,0:17:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You know that as well as I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.37,0:17:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,So make your move, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.39,0:17:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, time to make a move. Let's see,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.33,0:18:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,his alligator sword has\N1,500 attack points,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.81,0:18:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,and I don't have anything\Npowerful enough to beat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.25,0:18:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But I do have Big Shield Gardner,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.57,0:18:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,which has enough defense\Npoints to keep me safe for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.33,0:18:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But I still need to figure out a way\Nto win this duel without hurting Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.77,0:18:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That trap card might help me for\Nnow, until I can figure out a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.91,0:18:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.31,0:18:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I place this card face down,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.79,0:18:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,and then I shall summon my Karibo\Nin attack mode and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.99,0:18:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you playing some sort of a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.97,0:18:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Karibo's weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.23,0:18:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It only has 300 attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.83,0:18:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you play it in attack mode?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.83,0:18:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless you're trying to lose this\Nduel on purpose to save your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.33,0:18:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.24,0:18:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.29,0:18:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,If losing is your goal,\Nallow me to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.37,0:18:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't lose. Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.27,0:18:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll defeat you and free Joey\Nfrom your control. Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.85,0:18:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that this time\Nyou're in over your head, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.01,0:19:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,So now, Alligator Sword,\Nattack his Karibo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.73,0:19:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold it right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.01,0:19:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate face down card!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.21,0:19:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.91,0:19:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Alligator's sword is now locked\Nin my spellbinding circle!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.99,0:19:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Your monster's power has decreased\Nwhile my Karibo is safe and sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.71,0:19:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,He weakened it, but he still has nothing\Npowerful enough to destroy it. Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.49,0:19:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.19,0:19:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.87,0:19:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had enough of your childish games.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.49,0:19:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's time for me to\Nregain control of this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.65,0:19:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.56,0:19:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Because this worked so well last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.55,0:19:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll use another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.31,0:19:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hinokama, attack his life points!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.15,0:19:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.01,0:19:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell forever, Yugi!
